  "id": "passive-touch",
  "term": "passive touch",
  "definition": "Passive touch is the experience of being touched by another person, especially when their contact is directed toward one’s body in an intentional way. In the source context, it refers to receiving another person’s tactile stimulation rather than actively touching them.",
